---
description: Preserve the complete sensor channel counts
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use the full channelDrive and channelSensor counts reported by the sensor. Do not automatically subtract 1 from either dimension.
- ACM5 reports 20 × 20: show and record all 400 taxels, including the last column.
- Verify channels and frame size before acquisition. Never infer a smaller grid from an incomplete frame.
- Reference-column exclusion is an explicit opt-in for other hardware only; keep it disabled by default.
